pendataloader-pdf","variants":[{"src":"previews/variants/ac2ea2e9651fd117c30d76a5-320.webp","width":320,"height":200},{"src":"previews/variants/ac2ea2e9651fd117c30d76a5-640.webp","width":640,"height":400},{"src":"previews/variants/ac2ea2e9651fd117c30d76a5-960.webp","width":960,"height":600}]}],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["PDF Parser for AI-ready data. Automate PDF accessibility. Open-source.","🔍 PDF parser for AI data extraction — Extract Markdown, JSON (with bounding boxes), and HTML from any PDF. #1 in benchmarks (0.907 overall). Deterministic local mode + AI hybrid mode for complex pages.","♿ PDF accessibility automation — Auto-tag untagged PDFs into screen-reader-ready Tagged PDFs at scale. First open-source tool to generate Tagged PDFs end-to-end."],"features":["How accurate is it? — #1 in benchmarks: 0.907 overall, 0.928 table accuracy across 200 real-world PDFs including multi-column and scientific papers. Deterministic local mode + AI hybrid mode for complex pages…","Scanned PDFs and OCR? — Yes. Built-in OCR (80+ languages) in hybrid mode. Works with poor-quality scans at 300 DPI+ (hybrid mode)","Tables, formulas, images, charts? — Yes. Complex/borderless tables, LaTeX formulas, and AI-generated picture/chart descriptions all via hybrid mode (hybrid mode)","What's the problem? — Accessibility regulations are now enforced worldwide. Manual PDF remediation costs $50–200 per document and doesn't scale (regulations)","What's free? — Layout analysis + auto-tagging (Apache 2.0). Untagged PDF in → Tagged PDF out. No proprietary SDK dependency (auto-tagging)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opendataloader-project/opendataloader-pdf/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4f970be93bd661686074fc81d56c12821a56fe5a1124a79777fa49c81780a398","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:15:33.097Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T18:02:46.691Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T10:17:38Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://livedemo.sdk.hancom.com/en/dataloader?utm_source